 "text": "The crew is Randy Bresnik, Andre Douglas and Frank Rubio of NASA, and Luca Parmitano of the European Space Agency. In September they trained with Navy helicopter crews off San Diego, practicing being hoisted out of the water after splashdown. They've drilled escaping a capsule underwater, trained in their orange survival suits, and tasted nearly two hundred items of space food. Their mission will be about two weeks long, and it will never get farther than a few hundred miles from home.",
